        "line": 352,
        "text": "theorem parameterPartial_congr {J : Set ℝ} (hJ : IsOpen J) {F G : Field}\n    (he : ∀ p, p.2 ∈ J → F p = G p) {p : Point} (hp : p.2 ∈ J) :\n    parameterPartial F p = parameterPartial G p"
